{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmxm9a5hgwFnud7G6Qfj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd go with **Harel (הראל), the \"מניות\" track (קופה 8522)**. I'm fairly sure, but I didn't read the whole page.\n\nWhat decided it was the big number: \"24.04%\" next to \"3 שנים\". It was the highest on the first screen of the table, and none of the others I saw beat it. Harel is a name I know, it's at the top of the list, and its fee \"0.55% מההיסכון\" was about the lowest I saw. \"0% מההפקדות\" means nothing comes off when I put money in. It also manages \"7.3 מיליארד ₪\", so lots of people are in it.\n\nI did think about the S&P 500 track, since that's what my friends talk about. But Harel's was only \"13.7%\", so the מניות track looked better.\n\n**How it went**\n- **Top:** I saw the heading \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\" and that the \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\" button was already picked. Then \"דמי ניהול מההיסכון: מ-0.5% עד 0.73%\". All the fees are pretty much the same, so the fee isn't what picks it.\n- **Harel's rows:** I scrolled through Harel's group, then a bit of מור, אנליסט and מיטב. Same kinds of tracks with similar numbers. Some had the 3-year number for Analyst's גמיש at \"26.39%\", higher than Harel's. But Analyst is a name I don't really know, so I stuck with Harel.\n- **Where I stopped:** On screen 5 of 15. 143 tracks that all look alike is too many. If I hadn't had a pick by then I'd have closed it.\n\n**What I skipped**\n- The small text at the top about \"2025\" and \"ספטמבר 2026\".\n- The \"מה זה קופת גמל להשקעה\" link.\n- The \"?\" icons.\n- The other rows that just said \"פחות מ-3 שנים\". No number there, so I ignored them.\n\n**What I didn't get**\n- The two numbers in the \"חשיפה למניות ולמט\"ח\" column. \"מט\"ח\" means nothing to me, and the coloured circles meant nothing either. I guessed the more full a circle, the more \"stocks\".\n- \"8211 / 8522\" under \"קופה\". I guess it's some code.\n- \"מניות 101%\" at מיטב was weird. How do you get more than 100%?\n\n**What bothered me**\n- I'm not sure if \"24.04%\" is per year or the total for 3 years. The header said \"תשואה שנתית ממוצעת\", which I think means per year.\n- The 5-year number for the same track was \"14.64%\", much lower. I'm not sure which one to trust.\n- No button anywhere that says \"open one here\", so I still don't know what the first step is."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3738,"cache_read_input_tokens":9899,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3738},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1985a2a3-9eb7-475b-ae0f-ee73f4f5828f","uuid":"c1d8a146-6748-4108-b1d0-2bb49363fcdc","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:07:26.772Z","request_id":"req_011Cgmxm9MCG1xPjT6hS79p5"}
